"Fa Ram's land refills a cultivator's Qi fully through a night's sleep; few notice."
"Fa Ram's ambient Qi can advance a resident a full stage within weeks."
"Fa Ram's Dragon Veins were deliberately dredged up by the spirits Tianlan and Xiaoshi."
"Fa Ram's land grants strength and a kind of afterlife-awareness to its own dead."
"Bees who die for Fa Ram regain awareness as immortal sparks when they cross its boundary."
"Later, starving Spirit Beast rats will beg sanctuary at Fa Ram, then try to seize it."
